    "body": "Version: 1.1.0\n\n## Description\nChanging snowflake speed or size does not take effect immediately. The new values are applied only after changing the snowflake count.\n\n## Steps to reproduce\n1.\tChange snowflake speed or size.\n2.\tObserve that nothing changes.\n3.\tChange snowflake count.\n4.\tSpeed and size are applied.\n\n## Expected behavior\nSpeed and size should update immediately when changed.\n\n## Actual behavior\nSpeed and size update only after changing the snowflake count.",
